<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74340" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξῠ-όδους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όδοντος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with sharp
			teeth</i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				40.484
			</span></i>, with a neut.Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξῠ-όεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽὀξύἠ</span>
			<i>with beechen shaft, beechen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχεα ὀξυόεντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.568
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				50
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουρὶ μετάλμενος ὀξυόεντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.443
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1951.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: the deriv. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύς</span> is
			less probable.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
